ARRAY ITERATION

Array iteration means visiting or processing each element of an array one by one. JavaScript provides loops and array methods such as forEach(), map(), filter(), reduce(), some(), and every() for array iteration.

Array iteration का अर्थ है array के प्रत्येक element को एक-एक करके access या process करना।

Array के कई iterative methods callback function लेते हैं।

40. for...of

for...of iterates over the values of an array.

let fruits = ["Apple", "Mango", "Banana"];
for (let fruit of fruits) {
    console.log(fruit);
}
Output:
Apple
Mango
Banana
for...of → values

41. for...in

for...in iterates over the enumerable property keys/indexes.
let fruits = ["Apple", "Mango", "Banana"];
for (let index in fruits) {
    console.log(index);
}

Output:
0
1
2

for...in → index/key
for...of → value

